<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 71 0 R
/T (What went right)
/E (What went right)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (This project successfully developed a crowd-interactive system that allows spectators to influence a single player game in real-time. The final implementation demonstrates how multiple technologies can be combined to create a responsive and engaging experience, where both player and audience contribute to the outcome of the gameplay.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
